<title>USA: Catalina Lighting names new CFO.</title>
<headline>Catalina Lighting names new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Catalina Lighting Inc said on Thursday it named David Sasnett chief financial officer, replacing Dean Rappaport, who was named chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Sasnett was previously vice president of finance and company controller, Catalina said. COO was a new position, the company said.</p>
<p>Rappaport was chief financial officer and treasurer for the past eight years. Thomas Bluth was appointed treasurer, the company said.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
